  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You have mastered the basic <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bothan\" title=\"Bothan\">Bothan</a> philosophy of Six Questions to glean more information from contacts through fewer questions. As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>, you can designate a single target within line of sight and make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Knowledge (Galactic Lore)\">Knowledge (Galactic Lore)</a> check against a DC equal to 15 + the target's CL.<br><br>If the check is successful, you learn a target's Character Level, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Classes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Classes\">Classes</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ability_Scores\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Scores\">Ability Scores</a>, and the target's available <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Points\" title=\"Force Points\">Force Points</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Destiny_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Destiny Points\">Destiny Points</a>.",
